# Normalize line endings to LF for everything text-ish, so git enforces this regardless of which
# editor/tool touches a file - IDEs and ad-hoc scripts have flipped files to CRLF on this repo more
# than once. .sln is left alone: `dotnet sln` always rewrites it as CRLF+UTF-8-BOM anyway.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.sln text eol=crlf
